# RozeLynx — licensing

RozeLynx and its build machinery are free software; the complete
license texts are in [licenses/](licenses/).

- Mozilla Public License 2.0 (licenses/MPL-2.0): the browser patch
  tree — the LibreWolf privacy patches and the RozeLynx branding,
  C++ components, extension and host sources — and the built RozeLynx
  browser (Firefox is MPL-2.0).
- GNU General Public License 2.0 (licenses/GPL-2): the Gentoo ebuild
  template (`gentoo/firefox-template.ebuild`) and the Gentoo packaging
  in the ByteWheel overlay (https://github.com/ByteWheel/gentoo-overlay),
  per the Gentoo ebuild headers.
- GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 (licenses/LGPL-2.1):
  LGPL-2.1-licensed components of the built browser, per the ebuild's
  LICENSE="MPL-2.0 GPL-2 LGPL-2.1".
